    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d217">

                <pb facs="0393" n="294" sameAs="frus:frus1936v02/pg294"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">362.1121 Simpson, Lawrence/147: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul General at Berlin</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Jenkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-04-28T18:00:00-04:00">April 28, 1936—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your despatch 888.<anchor n="11" xml:id="d217-f1"/> Department approves your
                    action in seeking to expedite Simpson proceedings and requests that you continue
                    to press for an early trial.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
